WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.992
Group by and partition by both organize rows into groups, but they produce very different outputs.

00:00:06.992 --> 00:00:12.889
Group by usually collapses several detail rows into one summary row for each group.

00:00:13.425 --> 00:00:16.187
Partition by does not collapse the rows.

00:00:16.187 --> 00:00:22.007
It defines the context for a window calculation while keeping the detail rows.

00:00:22.007 --> 00:00:27.492
For example, group by can give one row per patient with average stay.

00:00:27.492 --> 00:00:34.041
A window function can keep every admission and place the patient's average stay beside each admission.
